hadiths[2]{hadithnumber,text}:
"57","[AI-translation] Ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de; ae mere Rab, mujhe bakhsh de. [Do sajdon ke darmiyan kahe]"
"58","[AI-translation] Ae Allah! Mujhe bakhsh de, mujh par raham kar, mujhe aafiyat de, mujhe hidayat de, mujhe rozi de [aur mujhe buland kar]. [Do sajdon ke darmiyan kahe]"
